1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:02,230
好了 搞定五个牛顿方程
Okay, five Newtonian equations down.

2
00:00:02,230 --> 00:00:04,420
只剩七个量子力学证明了
Only seven quantum mechanical proofs to go!

3
00:00:04,420 --> 00:00:06,790
小宇宙被甲烷点燃
We are cooking with C-H-4.

4
00:00:08,260 --> 00:00:09,740
用燃气点燃
Cooking with gas.

5
00:00:10,040 --> 00:00:11,250
她俩都单身 兄弟们
And they're both single, fellas.

6
00:00:11,250 --> 00:00:13,560
拜托 各位 我们就不能
Come on, guys. Can't we just have one day

7
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:15,570
互相尊重 互相支持一下吗
where we respect and support one another?

8
00:00:15,570 --> 00:00:16,850
大家好啊 我的家人们
Hello, family.

9
00:00:18,930 --> 00:00:20,240
我们的年度街区派对
There was an incident this morning

10
00:00:20,240 --> 00:00:21,850
在今天早上出了点意外
at our annual neighborhood block party.

11
00:00:21,850 --> 00:00:24,490
通常都是小卡负责娱乐活动
Cam usually provides the entertainment at these things,

12
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:27,210
但他今天有莉莉的生日派对 所以菲尔自愿帮忙
but he had Lily's birthday party, so Phil volunteered.

13
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:29,520
有了菲尔宝 谁要菲茨宝
Who needs a Fizbo if you can have a Philbo?

14
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:30,940
什么
What?!

15
00:00:31,440 --> 00:00:32,990
什么时候才能停啊
I mean, where does it end?

16
00:00:32,990 --> 00:00:34,870
好长啊 仔细想想
It's so long! It's comically long,

17
00:00:34,870 --> 00:00:36,360
长得好好笑啊
when you think about it.

18
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:39,520
问题是 菲尔很怕小丑
Thing is, Phil's terrified of clowns.

19
00:00:39,560 --> 00:00:42,040
我以为如果我自己是小丑 应该不会害怕
Just thought if I was the clown, I wouldn't be scared.

20
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:44,510
就好比给自己挠痒痒就不痒了一样
Like how you can't tickle yourself.

21
00:00:45,870 --> 00:00:46,910
塞巴斯蒂安 别跑
Sebastian, no!

22
00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:49,380
我来搞定 塞巴斯蒂安
I got this! Sebastian!

23
00:00:49,380 --> 00:00:50,780
你妈在担心你呀 伙计
Your mom's worried about you, buddy,

24
00:00:50,780 --> 00:00:53,310
虽然完全没必要...
even though there's absolutely no reason to be --

25
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,560
闻起来... 天呐
Smell -- oh, God.

26
00:00:58,010 --> 00:01:00,040
像...
S-s-

27
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:03,300
小丑...
s-clowns!

28
00:01:03,770 --> 00:01:04,550
亲爱的
Honey.

29
00:01:04,550 --> 00:01:06,120
到处都是小丑
They were everywhere.

30
00:01:07,510 --> 00:01:10,320
我意识到我今天早上给我们家丢脸了
I recognize that I embarrassed the family this morning,

31
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,050
但我跟你们保证
but I assure you that --

32
00:01:12,050 --> 00:01:15,370
菲尔 亲爱的 过来一下
Phil, honey, just come on over here for one second.

33
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:16,240
稍等片刻
Just a sec.

34
00:01:16,820 --> 00:01:20,570
亲爱的 你不是第一个穿上小丑服
Honey, you are not the first person to put on a clown outfit,

35
00:01:20,570 --> 00:01:22,730
走进满是镜子的房间 然后...
walk into a hall of mirrors, and --

36
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:24,270
我的意思是说
I guess what I'm saying

37
00:01:24,270 --> 00:01:26,670
如果你觉得你有必要做点什么
is if you think you need to do something

38
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:28,430
来弥补早上的事情
to make up for that,

39
00:01:28,730 --> 00:01:30,040
别这么想
don't think that.

40
00:01:30,040 --> 00:01:30,810
不
No!

41
00:01:30,900 --> 00:01:32,250
天哪 死机了
Oh, my God, the computer froze!

42
00:01:32,250 --> 00:01:33,610
老爸来救你
Daddy to the rescue!

43
00:01:33,610 --> 00:01:34,590
我觉得他听到了
Well, I feel heard.

44
00:01:34,590 --> 00:01:36,050
好吧 老爸 我觉得没关系
Yeah, you know what, Dad, I-I think it's okay.

45
00:01:36,050 --> 00:01:37,450
我只需要强制重置
I just need to do a hard reset --

46
00:01:37,450 --> 00:01:39,290
不 我觉得这不是重置的问题
No, I don't think it's a reset issue.

47
00:01:39,290 --> 00:01:41,490
我觉得是突波保护器坏了
I think the surge protector just blew.

48
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:45,020
我要直接给这玩意儿
I am going to plug this bad boy directly

49
00:01:45,020 --> 00:01:47,180
插上电源...
into the wall and..

50
00:01:48,250 --> 00:01:49,650
天哪 你烧了我的电脑
Oh, my God! You fried my computer!

51
00:01:49,650 --> 00:01:50,640
我们的作业都没了
All of our work is gone!

52
00:01:50,640 --> 00:01:52,810
亲爱的 冷静 这些硬盘都经过设计
Honey, calm down. These hard drives are designed

53
00:01:52,810 --> 00:01:54,270
可以承受高温...
to withstand temperatures of up --

54
00:01:54,270 --> 00:01:56,550
天哪 着火了
Oh, my God, it's on fire!

55
00:02:10,460 --> 00:02:11,630
该死
Damn it.

56
00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:14,300
怎么了
What is wrong?

57
00:02:14,300 --> 00:02:15,720
没事
Huh? Nothing.

58
00:02:16,180 --> 00:02:18,880
我完全忘了我的海军兄弟们
You know, I totally forgot some of my Navy buddies

59
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:20,020
一会儿要在市中心的
are meeting downtown later

60
00:02:20,020 --> 00:02:21,940
欧布莱恩酒吧小聚
for a little reunion at O'Brien's pub.

61
00:02:21,940 --> 00:02:23,970
今天没什么特别的事情
Well, nothing special is happening here today,

62
00:02:23,970 --> 00:02:25,240
我允许你去
so you have permission to go.

63
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,530
我本来也不需要你的允许啊
Well, I don't really need your permission.

64
00:02:26,530 --> 00:02:30,430
你为什么不闭嘴 免得我改变主意
Why don't you just keep quiet and take yes for an answer?

65
00:02:30,430 --> 00:02:34,240
我的帅气 厉害 完美的儿子来了
Ay, there's my handsome, perfect, amazing boy!

66
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:35,600
我不会去班级旅行的
Still not going on the class trip.

67
00:02:35,600 --> 00:02:37,710
你为什么这么傻 是因为我...
Why are you being such a dummy? Is this because I --

68
00:02:37,710 --> 00:02:39,080
老妈 我不想聊这个
Mom, I don't want to talk about it.

69
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,910
为什么这家里只有我一个人
Why am I the only one in this house

70
00:02:40,910 --> 00:02:43,740
愿意聊事情呢
that ever wants to talk about things?!

71
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:46,010
宝贝 怎么啦
Ay, papi, what is wrong?

72
00:02:46,010 --> 00:02:47,420
不是时候
Not now.

73
00:02:48,510 --> 00:02:49,810
好了 够了
Okay, that's it.

74
00:02:49,810 --> 00:02:51,860
如果这家里的爷们都不跟我说话
If the men in this house don't start talking to me,

75
00:02:51,860 --> 00:02:55,040
我向天发誓 我会让你们每个人
I swear to God that I will make life miserable

76
00:02:55,040 --> 00:02:57,060
都没有好日子过
for each and every one of you!

77
00:02:57,620 --> 00:02:59,140
不 等一下
No, not yet.

78
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:01,780
别告诉我停电了
Oh, don't tell me the power just went out!

79
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,490
我的智能床垫要停在小睡模式了
My Sleep Number bed is stuck on the nap setting.

80
00:03:03,490 --> 00:03:04,060
冷静
Calm down.

81
00:03:04,060 --> 00:03:06,590
这就是为什么我要买新的发电机
This is exactly why I sprung for a new generator.

82
00:03:06,590 --> 00:03:08,960
刚刚开了 不用谢
which, you're welcome, just kicked in.

83
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:10,640
当然了 没办法给所有电器供电
Now, granted, it doesn't power everything.

84
00:03:10,640 --> 00:03:12,500
所以我得作出一些艰难的抉择
I had to make some hard choices.

85
00:03:12,500 --> 00:03:14,720
所以只通酒吧和台球桌吗
That's it? The bar and the pool table?

86
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:16,970
冰箱都是黑的
The frigerator's black.

87
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:18,120
好了 杰 在给重要的几样电器
Okay, Jay, you're not leaving

88
00:03:18,120 --> 00:03:20,400
通完电之前 你不准走
until you put power in the important things.

89
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:22,890
我向天发誓 别把我逼得更生气
I swear to God, don't make me more mad than I already am!

90
00:03:22,890 --> 00:03:24,900
就不能等我回来再弄吗
Can't I just do it when I get back?

91
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:27,280
电母您能消停一会儿不
Would you stop doing that?!

92
00:03:29,010 --> 00:03:30,550
今天是莉莉的八岁生日
It's Lily's 8th birthday,

93
00:03:30,550 --> 00:03:32,780
我们本打算在后院办个小型派对
and we had a little backyard party planned.

94
00:03:32,780 --> 00:03:34,570
准备些热狗 气球
Hot dogs, some balloons --

95
00:03:34,570 --> 00:03:36,760
我们就打算随便弄一下
you know, I mean, we really just threw it together.

96
00:03:36,760 --> 00:03:38,550
就好像我去年的生日派对
Kind of like my birthday party last year.

97
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:40,540
好了 是你告诉我你不想要我做什么...
Okay, you told me that you did not want me to do anything --

98
00:03:40,540 --> 00:03:43,580
总之我们本来打算办一个简单的儿童派对
Anyway, we were all set for a casual kids' party,

99
00:03:43,580 --> 00:03:45,720
但是莉莉收到了一封邮件
but then Lily got an e-mail.

100
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:48,210
她要来 她要来 她要来 阿什利要来
She's coming! She's coming! She's coming! Ashley's coming!

101
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:49,050
阿什利要来吗
Ashley's coming?

102
00:03:49,050 --> 00:03:50,370
米奇尔 阿什利要来
Mitchell, Ashley's coming!

103
00:03:50,370 --> 00:03:52,080
天哪 等一下
Oh, my God! Well, now, wait a minute.

104
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:53,590
阿什利·S还是阿什利·W
Ashley S. Or Ashley W.?

105
00:03:53,590 --> 00:03:54,840
W
"W"!

106
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:57,970
阿什利·W要来
Ashley W.'s coming!

107
00:03:58,030 --> 00:04:00,800
阿什利是莉莉班上最受欢迎的女孩
Ashley is the most popular girl in Lily's class.

108
00:04:00,800 --> 00:04:01,910
就是说 你请是请了她
I mean, you invite her...

109
00:04:01,910 --> 00:04:03,680
但你觉得她是永远不可能来的
but you never think she's gonna accept.

110
00:04:03,680 --> 00:04:05,250
不 一定是哪里出错了 或者...
No. Something must have fallen through, or --

111
00:04:05,250 --> 00:04:07,670
重点是她能决定以后谁能和大家一起玩
The point is, she decides who's in and who's out.

112
00:04:07,950 --> 00:04:09,210
所以我们得提高派对的档次
So we had to up our game.

113
00:04:09,210 --> 00:04:10,320
这是个非常有趣的挑战
Which was a fun challenge.

114
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:11,790
是啊 考虑到我们已经有一段时间
Yeah, considering it had been a while

115
00:04:11,790 --> 00:04:14,520
没有办什么很华丽的生日派对了
since we'd thrown any sort of fabulous birthday party.

116
00:04:14,530 --> 00:04:16,090
你求我别搞得太大的 你说...
You begged me not to make a fuss. You said --

117
00:04:16,090 --> 00:04:18,080
因为我就是那种人对吧
Oh, because that sounds like me, yeah.

118
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:20,080
好了 等索菲上车
All right. Once Sophie boards the bus,

119
00:04:20,080 --> 00:04:22,000
我们就去公主公园
we will be on our way to the Princess Park,

120
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:25,930
每个人可以选她的公主服
where we will all pick out our princess costumes!

121
00:04:26,850 --> 00:04:29,000
我觉得阿什利玩得挺开心的
I think Ashley's having a really good time.

122
00:04:29,010 --> 00:04:30,110
是吗 你怎么知道
Yeah? How can you tell?

123
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:31,440
她人还没走
She's still here.

124
00:04:32,450 --> 00:04:33,770
不 这是下雨了吗
Oh, no! Is it raining?

125
00:04:33,770 --> 00:04:36,620
别担心 亲爱的 我们有遮阳伞
Not to worry, sweetie. We have parasols.

126
00:04:38,510 --> 00:04:39,270
可以了
It worked!

127
00:04:39,270 --> 00:04:41,450
好了 我把几个重要电器都通上电了
Good. I powered up all your essentials.

128
00:04:41,450 --> 00:04:43,030
我要去见我的兄弟们了
Now I'm gonna go meet my buddies.

129
00:04:43,030 --> 00:04:45,180
看来我的意式咖啡机不算重要电器
I see my espresso machine didn't make the cut,

130
00:04:45,180 --> 00:04:45,890
但我忍一忍吧
but I'll manage.

131
00:04:45,890 --> 00:04:48,110
我要见的兄弟里有一个曾经在大海上迷失方向
One of the guys I'm meeting was lost at sea once.

132
00:04:48,110 --> 00:04:49,420
他不得不吃水母为生
Had to eat a jellyfish.

133
00:04:49,420 --> 00:04:51,280
我会向他夸你很勇敢的
I'll speak to him of your courage.

134
00:04:53,190 --> 00:04:56,530
没电了 不得不过来 快速讲两句
So, power's out. Had to come over. Real quick.

135
00:04:56,530 --> 00:04:57,740
菲尔打扮成小丑
Phil got dressed up as a clown

136
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:59,320
走进一间全是镜子的房间恐慌发作
and then had a panic attack in a hall of mirrors,

137
00:04:59,330 --> 00:05:01,170
所以他想补偿一下
so he's gonna be looking to overcompensate for a lot,

138
00:05:01,170 --> 00:05:02,250
所以请别太沉浸于....
so please don't indulge in any of his --

139
00:05:02,250 --> 00:05:03,370
-杰 -来了
- Hey, Jay. - Right here.

140
00:05:03,370 --> 00:05:04,790
我记得你有台发电机
I remembered you had a generator.

141
00:05:04,790 --> 00:05:07,660
我要给艾丽克斯上传几个文件
I'm just gonna upload a few quick files for Alex.

142
00:05:07,670 --> 00:05:09,490
-别问了 -我从来没问过
- Don't ask. - I never do.

143
00:05:09,560 --> 00:05:11,500
我打不开这瓶子
I can't open the jar.

144
00:05:11,760 --> 00:05:14,200
幸运的你有个好叔叔
Well, lucky for you your uncle --

145
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:16,600
好姐夫菲尔在此
brother-in-law Phil is here.

146
00:05:16,710 --> 00:05:18,710
只需要轻轻一拧
And with one mighty twi--

147
00:05:19,990 --> 00:05:21,310
我们应该就能
We should be...

148
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,620
打开它了
good to go.

149
00:05:26,240 --> 00:05:27,300
-不 -不 不 不
-No! -No, no, no, no, no!

150
00:05:27,300 --> 00:05:28,570
不 不
No, no, no!

151
00:05:28,570 --> 00:05:30,500
爸 别再帮倒忙了
Dad, stop helping!

152
00:05:31,140 --> 00:05:32,000
你好啊 小怪兽
Hey, monster.

153
00:05:32,010 --> 00:05:33,290
你好啊
Hey, you.

154
00:05:35,190 --> 00:05:37,110
安迪和我的关系有一个火热激情的开端
Andy and I started out pretty hot and heavy,

155
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:39,730
不过这两周我特别得忙
but, uh, the last few weeks I've just been super busy,

156
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:41,440
所以我猜他感觉自己被忽略了
so I guess he's feeling neglected,

157
00:05:41,440 --> 00:05:43,210
所以他反应也有点冷淡
and he's acting a little cold.

158
00:05:43,210 --> 00:05:44,670
就在胳膊上拍两下算什么
I mean, a chuck on the arm?

159
00:05:44,670 --> 00:05:47,090
我们是哈克·费恩和汤姆·索亚的关系吗
What are we, Huck Finn and Tom Sawyer?

160
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:49,570
是有这么两个人 对吧
Those are people, right?

161
00:05:52,500 --> 00:05:54,140
这里有一滩水
Ay, there's a puddle!

162
00:05:54,140 --> 00:05:54,820
史黛拉或者乔弄的
Stella or Joe.

163
00:05:54,830 --> 00:05:55,900
过几个小时见
I'll see you in a couple of hours.

164
00:05:55,900 --> 00:05:57,370
不 不 不 看 漏水了
No, no, no, no! Look, it's a leak,

165
00:05:57,370 --> 00:05:59,140
因为是从墙缝留下来的
because it's coming through the wall.

166
00:05:59,140 --> 00:06:01,080
应该是房顶的排水槽又堵了
Most likely your gutters backed up.

167
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,160
包在我身上了
Consider it handled.

168
00:06:02,160 --> 00:06:03,300
跪求别叫我 跪求别叫我
Please don't ask me. Please don't ask me.

169
00:06:03,300 --> 00:06:05,360
卢克 修排水槽去
Luke! To the gutters!

170
00:06:09,100 --> 00:06:11,460
小公主们 城堡到了
Okay, princesses, your castle awaits!

171
00:06:11,460 --> 00:06:12,260
怎么回事
What gives?

172
00:06:12,260 --> 00:06:13,730
路上开始漫水了
The roads were starting to flood,

173
00:06:13,730 --> 00:06:15,640
所以我们想来这里躲风暴
so we were hoping to ride out the storm here.

174
00:06:15,640 --> 00:06:16,460
当然
Yeah, sure.

175
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:19,400
还有 爸 我们想继续公主的主题
Also, Dad, we're hoping to keep the princess theme alive,

176
00:06:19,400 --> 00:06:20,850
所以如果你可以假装
so if you could pretend to be a --

177
00:06:20,850 --> 00:06:22,350
-感兴趣吗 -不
- Interested? - No.

178
00:06:23,250 --> 00:06:23,840
好吧
Okay.

179
00:06:23,840 --> 00:06:25,770
女士们 到变装时间了 我们有...
Ladies, it's costume time! We have...

180
00:06:25,770 --> 00:06:26,450
公主装
Costumes!

